<title>USA: ValuJet ended Q1 with over $138 mln cash.</title>
<headline>ValuJet ended Q1 with over $138 mln cash.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ValuJet Inc said Wednesday it finished the first quarter with more than $138 million in cash.</p>
<p>Load factor for the quarter was 53.9 percent, compared to 58.0 percent a year earlier, the company said.</p>
</text>
